<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <title>Home - RaptorScanner</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>
<body>

  <nav class="navbar">
    <div class="logo">RaptorScanner</div>

    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="/">Home</a>
      <a href="/dashboard">Dashboard</a>
      <a href="/history">Scan History</a>
      <a href="/logout">Logout</a>
      <button id="themeToggle" class="theme-btn">🌙</button>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <section class="home-hero">
    <div class="home-hero-box">
      <h1>Welcome to RaptorScanner</h1>

      <p>
        RaptorScanner is a web-based malware file analysis dashboard inspired by
        VirusTotal. It helps users scan uploaded files, generate hash values, and
        view a simple risk report before opening files.
      </p>

      <a href="/dashboard" class="home-btn">Go to Dashboard</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-about">
    <h2>About Our Website</h2>

    <p>
      Many users download files from the internet without checking whether the
      files are safe. Some files may contain viruses, trojans, worms, or
      ransomware. RaptorScanner helps users check files through a simple and
      user-friendly dashboard.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="home-features">
    <h2>Main Features</h2>

    <div class="feature-grid">
      <div class="feature-box">
        <h3>Secure Login</h3>
        <p>Users can register and log in securely.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-box">
        <h3>File Upload</h3>
        <p>Users can upload files for analysis.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-box">
        <h3>Hash Generator</h3>
        <p>The system generates MD5, SHA-1, and SHA-256 hash values.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-box">
        <h3>Malware Scan</h3>
        <p>Uploaded files can be scanned using ClamAV.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-box">
        <h3>Risk Level</h3>
        <p>The system shows Low, Medium, or High risk level.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-box">
        <h3>Scan History</h3>
        <p>Users can view previous scan results.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer class="home-footer">
    <p>RaptorScanner | Final Year Project</p>
  </footer>

  <script src="/theme.js"></script>
</body>
</html>